  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A printer produces posters at a constant rate of <math alttext=\"42\"><mn>42</mn>\n</math> posters per minute. At what rate, in posters per <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">hour</span>, does the printer produce the posters?</p>",
